{"articleNo":"2351","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2351&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009 교육역량강화사업 상시 멘토 운영계획 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.02","hit":"15174","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 10pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼둥근헤드라인&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 13pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">『2009 교육역량강화사업』</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 신명 신그래픽, 한컴돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">상시 멘토 운영 계획 안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle1\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; MARGIN-TOP: 0pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 5pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">성공적인 공학교육의 실현을 위하여 학생 개개인의 교육경쟁력 강화 및 학습</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"> 효율성 증대를 위하여 공학교육의 기초과목인</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\"> MSC(수학, 물리, 화학, 컴퓨터)를 언제든지 쉽게 학습지도를 받을 수 있는 상시 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 14.3pt\">멘토링을 운영하오니 많은 이용 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -19.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 19.4pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 14.3pt\">□ 운영과목 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 14.3pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">수학, 물리, 화학, 컴퓨터</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 14.3pt\">□ 운영기간 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-SIZE: 14.3pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">2009. 11. 25(수) ~ 12. 15(화) - 3주간</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 14.3pt\">□ 교과목별 운영시간 및 장소</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\" class=\"HStyle1\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.9pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"61\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"102\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.7pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">구&nbsp; 분</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.9pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#d6d6d6\" height=\"61\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"127\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.7pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">테크노관</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING